        "text": "Facebook-f Twitter\nDONATE\nFacebook-f Twitter\nDONATE\nBy providing your mobile number, you consent to receive periodic campaign updates from Harder for Congress. Txt HELP for help, STOP to end. Msg & Data rates may apply.\nGET INVOLVED\nJOSH'S STORY\nDONATE\n## Meet Josh\nJosh grew up in the Valley and lives in Tracy with his wife Pam and their two young daughters, Lillian and Karina. He sees how expensive it’s getting to raise a family – from gas to housing to health care – and how our communities keep getting left behind. For too long politicians have put their own egos above actually getting things done for our families. Josh represents a new generation of leaders working to break the gridlock and fix the broken political system.\nJosh comes from the business world and is focused on the most important issues in our community like lowering costs, fighting homelessness and keeping our neighborhoods safe. That’s why Josh has support from a diverse coalition of voters from farmers and ranchers to union workers and law enforcement.\nLEARN MORE\n## Josh's Priorities\n## Fight for Health Care in the Valley\nHealth care is personal for Josh. His brother was born prematurely and the hospital left his family with a hundred page medical bill. He knows the health care system is broken, so he’s working to get costs down and bring more doctors to the Valley so everyone can get the care they need close to home.\nLEARN MORE\n## BRING DOWN PRICES FOR VALLEY FAMILIES\nJosh knows we have to get prices down to make our community an affordable place to raise a family again. He’s laser focused on cutting the price of gas, housing, and health care so everyone can live and raise their family in the Valley.\nLEARN MORE\n## KEEP OUR COMMUNITIES SAFE & HEALTHY\nJosh knows we can’t raise happy kids if they don’t have a safe and healthy community to grow up in. That’s why Josh is fighting for more funding for clean air and water, strong schools, and money to keep our families safe.\nLEARN MORE\n## GET UPDATES FROM JOSH\nBy providing your mobile number, you consent to receive periodic campaign updates from Harder for Congress. Txt HELP for help, STOP to end. Msg & Data rates may apply.\n## Volunteer Today\nControl of the House will be decided right here in the Valley. Join our grassroots movement. Sign up to volunteer for #TeamHarder today!\nVOLUNTEER TODAY\n## Young Josh!\nThe Valley has been my family's home for generations, and now my wife and I have a daughter of our own. For too long the Valley has been left behind by politicians. I'm running to change that. We have to protect our water, bring costs down, and keep our communities safe.\nJosh Harder\n## DONATE Now\n## $5\n## $25\n## $50\n## $100\n## Other Amount...\nCHIP IN\nDONATE\nFacebook-f Twitter\n#### Chip in to our campaign!\n## $5\n## $25\n## $50\n## $100\n## $200\n## Chip In\n#### Continue to Website →",
